{"4451940": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Mount Ymir", "steam_appid": 4451940, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ragnarök - The Gods twilight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount Ymir is an Isle covered in forest and nature interspersed with strange brutalist structures throughout. You are tasked with exploring this dark and atmospheric landscape by the truly titanic World serpent that ever looms over the isle. Your goal is to retrieve Potions of undeath created by the witches of midgard in order to revive the aesir god Baldur Odinson in an effort to postpone the coming end of the world. Ragnarök.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/027cc02433f4c2fc5c2937112ad5e774.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/027cc02433f4c2fc5c2937112ad5e774.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/027cc02433f4c2fc5c2937112ad5e774.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hrafn Óðins - Odin's raven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The allfather hunches on his throne inconsolable. His duties forgotten. His beast un-fed :- starved. Hugin and Munin search midgard for any meat not yet eaten. They search for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/4973f6ccdc5f85504a55a9170b21d58c.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/4973f6ccdc5f85504a55a9170b21d58c.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/4973f6ccdc5f85504a55a9170b21d58c.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Andsetinn - Haunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the apocalypse lies on the horizon the souls of the dead wander the isle. Bitter that they could not reach Valhalla they now hunt the living and cry out to Odin when they find you. Be aware, their screams reverberate so loud that the allfathers crows become ravenous and hunt you. Stay away from the draugr of Midgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/2d6622e2d3e6cf595366638b17ac2340.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/2d6622e2d3e6cf595366638b17ac2340.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/2d6622e2d3e6cf595366638b17ac2340.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Völvur - Witches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your efforts to postpone the end times you must acquire the potions of undeath created by witches that once walked upon midgard. With them in hand you may approach the body of the dead god and complete your task</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/98b5004557e95d9d8feedb2be55e4985.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=612 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/98b5004557e95d9d8feedb2be55e4985.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/98b5004557e95d9d8feedb2be55e4985.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features - What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person adventure horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple distinct levels accessed in a linier fashion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gamified perspective on real Norse mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genuine old Norse/Icelandic dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Of prose edda</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before everything there was Ginnungagap :- nothing. from it came Ymir the progenitor of all. And of his body came the world when Odin and his brothers slew him like a wretched beast. His blood became the ocean and his flesh the soil. They planted his hair in the earth and tossed his brain into the sky creating the clouds above the Isle of Mount ymir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/bfbdbbb1d889a14c5167635ef7b27b6a.avif?t=1778761638\" width=348 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>Image: Ymir gets himself killed by odin and his brothers</i> by <strong>lorenz</strong> <strong>Frølich</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ragnarök - The Gods twilight</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mount Ymir is an Isle covered in forest and nature interspersed with strange brutalist structures throughout. You are tasked with exploring this dark and atmospheric landscape by the truly titanic World serpent that ever looms over the isle. Your goal is to retrieve Potions of undeath created by the witches of midgard in order to revive the aesir god Baldur Odinson in an effort to postpone the coming end of the world. Ragnarök.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/027cc02433f4c2fc5c2937112ad5e774.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/027cc02433f4c2fc5c2937112ad5e774.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/027cc02433f4c2fc5c2937112ad5e774.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hrafn Óðins - Odin's raven</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The allfather hunches on his throne inconsolable. His duties forgotten. His beast un-fed :- starved. Hugin and Munin search midgard for any meat not yet eaten. They search for you</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/4973f6ccdc5f85504a55a9170b21d58c.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/4973f6ccdc5f85504a55a9170b21d58c.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/4973f6ccdc5f85504a55a9170b21d58c.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Andsetinn - Haunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the apocalypse lies on the horizon the souls of the dead wander the isle. Bitter that they could not reach Valhalla they now hunt the living and cry out to Odin when they find you. Be aware, their screams reverberate so loud that the allfathers crows become ravenous and hunt you. Stay away from the draugr of Midgard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/2d6622e2d3e6cf595366638b17ac2340.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/2d6622e2d3e6cf595366638b17ac2340.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/2d6622e2d3e6cf595366638b17ac2340.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Völvur - Witches</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In your efforts to postpone the end times you must acquire the potions of undeath created by witches that once walked upon midgard. With them in hand you may approach the body of the dead god and complete your task</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/98b5004557e95d9d8feedb2be55e4985.poster.avif?t=1778761638\" width=612 height=294 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/98b5004557e95d9d8feedb2be55e4985.webm?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/98b5004557e95d9d8feedb2be55e4985.mp4?t=1778761638\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >features - What to expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A first person adventure horror experience</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two enemy types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >multiple distinct levels accessed in a linier fashion</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A gamified perspective on real Norse mythology</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Genuine old Norse/Icelandic dialogue</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Of prose edda</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Before everything there was Ginnungagap :- nothing. from it came Ymir the progenitor of all. And of his body came the world when Odin and his brothers slew him like a wretched beast. His blood became the ocean and his flesh the soil. They planted his hair in the earth and tossed his brain into the sky creating the clouds above the Isle of Mount ymir.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/extras/bfbdbbb1d889a14c5167635ef7b27b6a.avif?t=1778761638\" width=348 height=335 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: right\"><i>Image: Ymir gets himself killed by odin and his brothers</i> by <strong>lorenz</strong> <strong>Frølich</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Norse prophecy told through first-person atmospheric horror. Baldur Odinson is dead and the world serpent tasks you with stopping Ragnarök. Collect potions of undeath on the Mount Ymir isle while evading the ghosts of vikings and hope the allfather's horrid crows never find you.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/aa4d446994bafa5626c416951a4962a3a8e4ee47/header.jpg?t=1778761638", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/159c1b0a77738d55e002c2648d3d5c60c59ddea9/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1778761638", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/159c1b0a77738d55e002c2648d3d5c60c59ddea9/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1778761638", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core 2 Duo 2.8Ghz or equivalent<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 660<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GeForce GTX 1660</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["LillexStudios"], "publishers": ["LiillexStudios"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "25", "description": "Adventure"}], "screenshots": [{"id": 0, "path_thumbnail": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451940/303c56bb7a8157fff07ee1f9ca14a6ac6b8adad0/ss_303c56bb7a8157fff07ee1f9ca14a6ac6b8adad0.600x338.jpg?t=1778761638", "path_full": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps